        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Myeloid mononuclear recirculating leukocyte that can act as a precursor of tissue macrophages, osteoclasts and some populations of tissue dendritic cells.</owl:annotatedTarget>
