        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic neuron with a soma found in cortical layer 5. The standard transcriptomic reference data for this cell type can be found on the CellxGene census under the collection: &apos;Transcriptomic cytoarchitecture reveals principles of human neocortex organization&apos;, dataset: &apos;Supercluster: IT-projecting excitatory neurons&apos;, Author Categories: &apos;CrossArea_subclass&apos;, L5 IT.</obo:IAO_0000115>
