        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A cerebellar granule cell of the Homo sapiens brain. These cells can be distinguished from other cells in the brain by their selective expression of RELN (Hsap), RP11-649A16.1 (Hsap), RP11-81F8.1 (Hsap), RP11-97F8.2 (Hsap). The soma of these cells can be found in the cerebellum, pons, myelencephalon. The reference data for this cell type is CS202210140_311.</obo:IAO_0000115>
