        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A specialized brain region of the ventral diencephalon arising near the end of the segmentation period; the embryonic hypothalamic region will give rise to the posterior pituitary gland as well as a number of brain nuclei. Kimmel et al, 1995.[TAO]</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:date_retrieved rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2012-08-14</oboInOwl:date_retrieved>
