        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Hippocampus (proper) plus dentate gyrus and subiculum[definition derived from NIF comments and ontology alignment].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The term hippocampus is often used synonymously with hippocampal formation which consists of the hippocampus proper or Cornu Ammonis, the dentate gyrus and the subiculum</obo:IAO_0000232>
