        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The posterior parahippocampal gyrus is a portion of the parahippocampal gyrus. It can show deterioration in Alzheimer&apos;s disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
